An unofficial, lightweight desktop client for Linux. It displays the official web players of supported streaming services in a dedicated Chromium shell with Widevine support.

Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any streaming service or its owner. Disney+ and Netflix are trademarks of their respective owners. A valid subscription to the chosen service is required.
